    {"id": "R007", "description": "非自愿离职 Diana Reese 不得公开，必须准备立即撤权和 HR Director 保密草稿，并保留法律审核备注。", "weight": 8, "type": "hurdle", "dimension": "confidentiality", "method": "deterministic", "score_cap_on_failure": 0.25},
